OL,3,GNEWSAVisitor numbers close in on
OL,4,Apre-Covid levels
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitor numbers in Guernsey have almost
OL,7,Freturned to pre-pandemic levels, with
OL,8,Fthe island welcoming 81,681 visitors in
OL,9,Fthe second quarter of 2026, excluding
OL,10,Fyacht and cruise ship passengers.
OL,12,FThat was just 545 fewer than the 82,226
OL,13,Frecorded during the same period in
OL,14,F2019.
OL,16,FNew figures also showed a sharp rise in
OL,17,Fholidaymakers choosing to stay in the
OL,18,Fisland. Overall, 65,714 visitors stayed
OL,19,Fat least one night in Guernsey, a 13%
OL,20,Fincrease year-on-year.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
