OL,3,GNEWSAVisitor numbers close in on
OL,4,Apre-Covid levels
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest Travel and Visitor
OL,7,FAccommodation Bulletin found day trip
OL,8,Fvisitor numbers also increased. Some
OL,9,F15,967 people arrived by plane or ferry
OL,10,Fwithout staying overnight, up 24% on
OL,11,Fthe previous year.
